question 'What is the primary purpose of an Application Programming Interface (API) in web development?'

wrong 'To store a website\'s images and files on the user\'s device so pages load faster'
right 'To define the rules that allow different software applications to communicate and share data'
wrong 'To describe the visual layout of a web page using style rules'
wrong 'To compile JavaScript code into a format that browsers can execute'

